"Monrovia, Freetown and Libreville: one coast, one founding idea.", "Three powers had the same notion within forty years of each other, and none of them thought to compare notes. The Americans put freed slaves ashore at Monrovia, the British at Freetown, the French at Libreville - the free town, in case the point was missed. Between them lies the Kru coast, whose sailors crewed the ships that carried all three. The descendants of those settlements have more in common with each other than with the empires that dropped them here, and they have started saying so."], "Project_MareNostrum": ["All Roads Lead to Rome", "Broad claims in continental Europe, including European Russia. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout continental Europe, including European Russia for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Claims on the Italian core are peaceful. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."], "Project_CataTweaks_RomanAfrica": ["Scipio’s Legacy", "Broad claims in Africa and its adjacent islands. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout Africa and its adjacent islands for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."], "Project_CataTweaks_RomanIndia": ["Beyond Alexander", "Broad claims in the Indian subcontinent, including Pakistan, Bangladesh, Nepal, Bhutan, Sri Lanka and the Maldives. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout the Indian subcontinent, including Pakistan, Bangladesh, Nepal, Bhutan, Sri Lanka and the Maldives for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."], "Project_CataTweaks_RomanNorthAmerica": ["Beyond the Pillars", "Broad claims in North America, Central America, Greenland and the Caribbean. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout North America, Central America, Greenland and the Caribbean for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."], "Project_CataTweaks_RomanSouthAmerica": ["Under Southern Stars", "Broad claims in South America. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout South America for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."], "Project_ImperiumSineFine": ["Empire Without End", "Broad claims in the rest of Asia, including the Middle East, Siberia, East Asia and Southeast Asia. +10 control point capacity.", "Grants territorial claims throughout the rest of Asia, including the Middle East, Siberia, East Asia and Southeast Asia for incremental conquest. New foreign claims are hostile. Requires Great Nations and is independent of the other Roman regional projects. Completing this project grants the researching faction +10 control point capacity. Available only in Broken Earth."]}, "meta": {"Project_TheSunNeverSets": {"cost": "25,000", "gate": "Commonwealth Restored + Great Nations", "holder": "United Kingdom", "scope": "All five scenarios"}, "Project_NewLiberia": {"cost": "20,000", "gate": "Greater Dominion + Great Nations", "holder": "Liberia", "scope": "All five scenarios"}, "Project_CommonwealthRestored